  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Relief and Early Recovery Programme 2010 - CADEC National Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improve food availability for the most vulnerable households and children
2. Improve water supply and sanitation for vulnerable households
3. Improve food security and variety for the most vulnerable households through increased livelihoods assets and access to cash and food
4. Reduce community vulnerability to disasters

The programme will be implemented in four  dioceses which are Caritas Gweru, Caritas Gokwe Caritas Chinhoyi and Caritas Masvingo</narrative>
  </description>
